                    <h3 class="fw-bold text-navy mb-3">About IQAC</h3>
                    <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed" style="text-align: justify;">
                        The Internal Quality Assurance Cell (IQAC) of AGMRCET was established in accordance with the guidelines of NAAC. The primary aim of IQAC is to develop a system for conscious, consistent, and catalytic action to improve the academic and administrative performance of the institution. It oversees quality initiatives, curriculum reviews, teaching-learning methodologies, and feedback systems to align institution outcomes with international education benchmarks.
                    </p>
                    
                    <h5 class="fw-bold text-navy mt-4 mb-3">Objectives of IQAC</h5>
                    <ul class="text-muted small ps-3">
                        <li class="mb-2">To promote measures for institutional functioning towards quality enhancement through internalization of quality culture.</li>
                        <li class="mb-2">To facilitate the creation of a learner-centric environment conducive to quality education and faculty maturation.</li>
                        <li class="mb-2">To coordinate feedback response from students, parents, and other stakeholders on quality-related institutional processes.</li>
                        <li class="mb-2">To organize inter and intra-institutional workshops, seminars on quality-related themes and promotion of quality circles.</li>
                    </ul>
